<title>USA: Donaldson Lufkin files $1 bln debt shelf.</title>
<headline>Donaldson Lufkin files $1 bln debt shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Inc filed Friday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf offering of up to $1 billion in debt securities.</p>
<p>The New York-based firm said proceeds from the sale will be used for general corporate purposes and may be invested in short term securities.</p>
<p>No underwriters were named in the shelf offering.</p>
</text>
